{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And they commanded Yosef.</b> They gave orders to the servants of Yaakov or to others concerning Yosef, as in וַיְצַוֵּם אֶל בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל (Exodus 6:13)." "<b>Saying: Your father commanded.</b> He commanded that they say to Yosef, 'Your father commanded us' — meaning that we say this to you on our own initiative, not from him, for he did not suspect you at all, but rather that if your brothers fear you, we are to say these things to you." "<b>Before his death.</b> He gave this command during that period, and we had no opportunity to speak to you then."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:33.532329683Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}